   "source_size": 7,
   "en": "No",
   "full_en": "No",
   "decision": "Negative answer No."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:00000288",
   "va": 2325128,
   "source_sha256": "de796df2220ebd5db1da85c803e1acf5ccb114f60583cbe8a33ec1c3446631d4",
   "source_size": 7,
   "en": "Deck",
   "full_en": "Deck",
   "decision": "Retain Deck as the written ship/menu location label."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:00000290",
   "va": 2325136,
   "source_sha256": "8cc511b2f86e7c4a5e89f496cd393ef79dc84b8e9242d8541f3790d5c7bc8634",
   "source_size": 5,
   "en": "To Town",
   "full_en": "To Town",
   "decision": "To Town preserves the explicit destination direction \u3078."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:00000298",
   "va": 2325144,
   "source_sha256": "3cad0f1b58362ed09661969571f6534fada3e7853f51e270a70ee8323433b451",
   "source_size": 5,
   "en": "Modify",
   "full_en": "Modify",
   "decision": "Modify preserves \u6539\u9020 without promising a particular stat increase."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:000002A0",
   "va": 2325152,
   "source_sha256": "cfdaf88f9ed1a498b64c9fdac811ef22a88c56dbb457ae35ed01bc2b97bf723f",
   "source_size": 5,
   "en": "Recovery",
   "full_en": "Recovery",
   "decision": "Recovery is the complete nominal menu term, with no invented patient or HP-only restriction."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:000002A8",
   "va": 2325160,
   "source_sha256": "d6235635f5b779e95d421c46c227b6e0603d1630598880e0b6cc3e7dd42b0cd9",
   "source_size": 5,
   "en": "Information",
   "full_en": "Information",
   "decision": "Information is the full nominal heading; Info is an optional ordinary UI abbreviation."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:000002B0",
   "va": 2325168,
   "source_sha256": "3f5ffd8d10daf7ec347f91e2f7df467fcf955cffac25a5d600ea78e90f7c4a42",
   "source_size": 5,
   "en": "Depart",
   "full_en": "Depart",
   "decision": "Depart preserves leaving port, not arriving or deploying a battle unit."
  },
  {
   "id": "ELF/sdata:00000438",
